{# Check list: a list of audience / qualifier items, each with an accent check
   glyph (✓) marker beside the item text. The "Zielgruppe" (target-audience)
   device on ST-02 — dropped INSIDE a callout_panel body so it reads as a tint
   qualifier panel. All under the c-check-list namespace; the token-only look
   (accent check, item rhythm) lives in styles/components.css.

   items  list of strings (the audience qualifiers). Plain text — escaped by the
          pattern before it reaches here is NOT required (autoescape is off, but
          the pattern passes trusted text); empty list yields nothing fragile.
#}
{% macro check_list(items) -%}
{% if items %}
<ul class="c-check-list">
  {% for item in items %}
  <li class="c-check-list__item">
    <span class="c-check-list__check" aria-hidden="true">&check;</span>
    <span class="c-check-list__text">{{ item }}</span>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
{% endif %}
{%- endmacro %}
